  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women at Work &#x2013; Economic Justice for All - Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Uganda, the programme will directly target rural women from women-led cooperatives in agribusiness and trade, with an indirect impact on more than ten-fold those directly reached by the programme. The main focus will be on improving business management and ensure new women-owned businesses are adequately registered including capacity building in production, sales and marketing in a sustainable manner.</narrative>
  </description>
